    bridge: "In Scro, approve the sharp face for the talk before the mouth moves. A blurred gesture can be its own beat in a product or explainer reel. Do not lock a smeared eye as the host. If the eyes streaked, reject that still and regenerate. Trim the opening silence, caption in one of 13 styles, and export 9:16. Label the realistic host as AI. A cartoon is a different case.",
